--- code
export enum SettlementClaim {
  Supported = 'supported',
  Refused = 'refused',
  Unknown = 'unknown',
}
--- facts
Only a clearing house's refusal is `Refused`, because the settlement tests record that claim as the result without settling. Anything no house established is `Unknown`, and those tests settle it.
